sequenceDiagram
    title Legacy status update can erase v1alpha2-only component data
    actor Legacy as v1alpha1 client
    participant API as Karmada API server
    participant Convert as Conversion webhook
    participant Admission as Validating webhook
    participant Store as etcd (v1alpha2 storage)

    Legacy->>API: PUT or PATCH ResourceBinding/status (v1alpha1)
    API->>Store: Read current object
    Store-->>API: v1alpha2 spec with Components
    API->>Convert: Convert stored object to v1alpha1
    Convert-->>API: Legacy projection without Components
    API->>API: Copy legacy old spec and replace status

    alt Current configuration
        Note over API,Admission: Main-resource rule does not match /status
        API->>Convert: Convert updated object to storage version
        Convert-->>API: v1alpha2 object without Components
        API->>Store: Persist status update
        Note over Store: Component scheduling data is erased
    else Proposed PR1 guard
        API->>Admission: Exact v1alpha1 legacy-write admission
        Admission->>API: GET current object as v1alpha2
        API->>Store: Read authoritative storage state
        Store-->>API: Component-aware spec
        API-->>Admission: Current v1alpha2 object
        Admission--xAPI: Deny and require v1alpha2 writer
        API--xLegacy: Return Forbidden
        Note over Store: Existing spec remains unchanged
    end
